  "notes": "Generated from .config/zmk/config/go60.keymap by mise run zmk-layout. The keymap file is the source of truth; edits made here are not carried back.\n\nTwo things cannot be expressed here and are shown approximately:\n- Space is a plain &kp SPACE. The real binding is a mod-morph that sends 英数 before Ctrl+Space (the tmux/herdr prefix).\n- The editor rejects LA(LEFT), LA(RIGHT), LC(LA(LGUI)) and LC(SPACE), so ; shows as Cmd instead of ⌘⌥⌃ (Raycast), and Nav's , / . show as bare arrows instead of Opt+←/→ (word-wise movement).",
